---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { 
  HiOutlineCalendarDays, 
  HiOutlineArrowTopRightOnSquare, 
  HiOutlineBell,
  HiOutlineDocumentText,
  HiOutlineAcademicCap,
  HiOutlineBuildingOffice,
  HiOutlineExclamationTriangle,
  HiOutlineInformationCircle
} from "react-icons/hi2";

const title = "Maharashtra Arogya Bharti 2026: Recruitment for 7,195 Group C & Group D Posts";
const description = "Maharashtra Public Health Department (Arogya Bharti) 2026: Apply online for 7,195 vacancies including Group C (5,307 posts) and Group D (1,888 posts). Read exam pattern, criteria, and conducting agency updates.";
const canonicalURL = "https://mahasandhi.in/arogya-bharti-2026";
const date = "July 12, 2026";
const category = "Latest Job";
---

<Layout 
  title={title} 
  description={description}
  canonicalURL={canonicalURL}
  image="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160550-2173dba999ef?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1200"
  article={true}
  customBreadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Current Recruitment", url: "/current-recruitment" },
    { name: "Arogya Bharti" }
  ]}
>
  <article class="py-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="bg-primary/10 text-primary px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          {category}
        </span>
        <span class="text-text-muted text-sm">• {date}</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-text-main mb-6 leading-[1.25] flex flex-col gap-1">
        <span class="text-primary/95 text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-black block">महाराष्ट्र आरोग्य विभाग भरती २०२६: ७,१९५ गट क व गट ड पदांची मेगा भरती</span>
        <span class="text-text-secondary text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg font-bold block">{title}</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-primary pl-6 py-2 italic">
        {description}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Navigation Links -->
    <div class="flex gap-4 mb-8">
      <a href="#marathi-version" class="text-primary font-bold text-sm hover:underline">↓ मराठी माहिती (Marathi Info)</a>
      <span class="text-text-muted">|</span>
      <a href="#english-version" class="text-primary font-bold text-sm hover:underline">↓ English Info</a>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= MARATHI VERSION ================= -->
    <div id="marathi-version" class="space-y-6 text-text-main leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-2">सार्वजनिक आरोग्य विभाग (Arogya Department) मेगा भरती २०२६</h2>

      <p>
        <strong>Introduction:</strong> महाराष्ट्र शासनाच्या सार्वजनिक आरोग्य विभागाने राज्यभरातील विविध शासकीय रुग्णालये आणि केंद्रांमध्ये <strong>७,१९५ रिक्त पदांसाठी</strong> मेगा भरतीची घोषणा केली आहे. यामध्ये प्रामुख्याने गट क (Group C) आणि गट ड (Group D) संवर्गातील पदांचा समावेश आहे. पात्र उमेदवारांसाठी आवश्यक असणारी सविस्तर माहिती खालीलप्रमाणे आहे.
      </p>

      <!-- Post Details Box -->
      <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-2xl my-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 mt-0">
          🔥 रिक्त पदे आरोग्य भरती २०२६ (Vacancy Distribution)
        </h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-bg-base border border-border-card/45 p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
            <span class="block text-2xl font-black text-text-main">५,३०७</span>
            <span class="block text-xs text-text-muted font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">गट क (Group C)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-bg-base border border-border-card/45 p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
            <span class="block text-2xl font-black text-text-main">१,८८८</span>
            <span class="block text-xs text-text-muted font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">गट ड (Group D)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/5 border border-primary/25 p-4 rounded-xl text-center sm:col-span-1 col-span-full">
            <span class="block text-2xl font-black text-primary">७,१९५</span>
            <span class="block text-xs text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">एकूण पदे (Total Vacancies)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Critical Alert Box -->
      <div class="bg-amber-500/10 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-5 rounded-r-2xl my-6">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-2 mt-0 mb-2">
          <HiOutlineExclamationTriangle className="text-lg shrink-0" /> महत्त्वाचा इशारा (Important Notice)
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-main m-0 font-semibold leading-relaxed">
          ⚠️ शेवटची ओळ सर्वात महत्त्वाचे आहे: ही परीक्षा <strong>MPSC (महाराष्ट्र लोकसेवा आयोग)</strong> किंवा <strong>TCS (Tata Consultancy Services)</strong> यांच्या मार्फत पारदर्शक पद्धतीने घेण्यात यावी, असं निर्देशीत करण्यात आले आहे.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Info Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6">
        <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-4 rounded-xl flex items-start gap-3">
          <HiOutlineBuildingOffice className="text-primary text-2xl shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-text-muted block uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">विभाग (Department)</span>
            <span class="text-text-main font-semibold text-sm">सार्वजनिक आरोग्य विभाग, महाराष्ट्र शासन</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-4 rounded-xl flex items-start gap-3">
          <HiOutlineAcademicCap className="text-primary text-2xl shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-text-muted block uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">पात्रता (Eligibility)</span>
            <span class="text-text-main font-semibold text-sm">१० वी, १२ वी उत्तीर्ण / पदविका (Diploma) / पदवी (Degree)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Official Links Table -->
      <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-primary mb-2 mt-8 border-l-4 border-primary pl-3">अर्ज आणि जाहिरात लिंक्स (Important Links)</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mt-3 mb-8">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-primary/10">
              <th class="p-3 border border-border-card font-bold text-text-main">तपशील (Event)</th>
              <th class="p-3 border border-border-card font-bold text-text-main">तारीख / लिंक (Details / Action)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card text-text-muted font-medium">ऑनलाइन अर्ज करण्याची तारीख (Registration Schedule)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card text-amber-500 font-bold">लवकरच घोषित होईल (To Be Announced)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card text-text-muted font-medium">अधिकृत जाहिरात PDF (Official Notification)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card">
                <button disabled class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold uppercase rounded border border-amber-500/25 cursor-not-allowed text-xs">
                  <HiOutlineBell className="animate-bounce" /> लवकरच उपलब्ध (Notification Soon)
                </button>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card text-text-muted font-medium">अधिकृत संकेतस्थळ (Official Website)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card">
                <a href="https://arogya.maharashtra.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold uppercase rounded border border-primary/25 hover:bg-primary/20 text-xs">
                  arogya.maharashtra.gov.in <HiOutlineArrowTopRightOnSquare />
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= LANGUAGE SEPARATOR ================= -->
    <div class="my-16 border-t-2 border-dashed border-border-card flex items-center justify-center relative">
      <span class="absolute bg-bg-base px-8 py-2 text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary border border-border-card rounded-full shadow-md">
        English Information
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= ENGLISH VERSION ================= -->
    <div id="english-version" class="opacity-95 space-y-6 text-text-main leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-2">Maharashtra Public Health Department Recruitment 2026</h2>

      <p>
        The Public Health Department of Maharashtra is initiating a large-scale recruitment drive for <strong>7,195 positions</strong> across diverse medical and administrative roles under Group C and Group D cadres.
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mt-3 mb-8">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-primary/10">
              <th class="p-3 border border-border-card font-bold text-text-main">Cadre</th>
              <th class="p-3 border border-border-card font-bold text-text-main">Number of Vacancies</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card text-text-muted font-medium">Group C (गट क)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card text-text-main font-bold">5,307</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card text-text-muted font-medium">Group D (गट ड)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card text-text-main font-bold">1,888</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-primary/5">
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card font-bold text-text-main">Total Posts</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-border-card text-primary font-black">7,195</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-amber-500/10 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-5 rounded-r-2xl">
        <span class="block text-xs font-extrabold uppercase text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 mb-1">Testing Authority Update</span>
        <p class="text-xs m-0 text-text-main leading-relaxed">
          The government reports that the recruitment exams for these vacancies are recommended to be conducted through either the <strong>MPSC</strong> or <strong>TCS (Tata Consultancy Services)</strong> platforms to ensure a transparent merit listing process.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
